# Silicon Labs Project Configuration Tools: slcp, v0, Component selection file.

project_name: BreathSense_xG26_Node_V2
label: BreathSense_xG26_Node_V2

description: |
  BreathSense is an embedded acoustic monitoring node for EFR32MG26.
  It continuously captures microphone audio and runs a two-stage
  TensorFlow Lite Micro pipeline. Stage 1 detects cough, speech,
  sneeze and other audio. Stage 2 classifies detected cough events
  as dry, wet or unknown. The node also samples temperature and
  humidity from an Si7021-compatible sensor and publishes events
  and environmental data through Bluetooth LE GATT notifications.

category: AI/ML Application

filter:
- name: Capability
  value:
  - Machine Learning

- name: Device Type
  value:
  - SoC

- name: MCU
  value:
  - 32-bit MCU

- name: Project Difficulty
  value:
  - Advanced

